              "__typename": "User",
              "login": "khluu"
            },
            "body": "Fresh independent recurrence on main nightly [#88743 B200 Sequence Parallel Correctness](https://buildkite.com/vllm/ci/builds/88743/jobs/01a09e82-828a-4096-b330-7f01af61cce8) at `10e8d5614c50ad180acbe61878c93d98ca7098a9`:\n\n- the first three sequence-parallel cases passed;\n- `test_tp_sp_nvfp4_generation` again diverged between two `--load-format dummy` server starts;\n- the reference emitted `['!!!!!', '!!!!!']`, while the SP run emitted `['!!!!!', ' Receeba错误 modelAndViewcessive']`;\n- job summary: 1 failed / 3 passed.\n\nThis is the same uninitialized dummy NVFP4-weight family that this PR removes. The exact PR-head B200 suite proof in #87894 remains the relevant fix validation; no unchanged retry is needed to establish source causality.\n",
